  "title": "Wellesley Fudge Cake",
  "description": "Follow this Wellesley fudge cake recipe for two 9-inch layers of rich, chocolaty cake that can be frosted with fudge frosting or any frosting you like.",
  "authors": [
    "Juanita"
  ],
